SELECT '5e7b257e-10b3-7d90-a0d5-f557973e4a07', '48aa367e-d5d4-733d-97bb-bc075bda09c5', 'Dropbox Sync', 'Dropbox Sync', 'Global file synchronization service storing petabytes of user data. Key challenges: block-level chunking, deduplication, conflict resolution, delta sync.
Block Chunking & Deduplication
Files are split into fixed 4MB Chunk Blocks. Each chunk is hashed using SHA-256.
 • Deduplication: Before uploading a chunk, client queries Metadata DB for the chunk''s SHA-256 hash. If hash exists, upload is skipped! Saves ~40% cloud storage.
 • Delta Sync: When a file is edited, only modified 4MB chunks are uploaded.
System Architecture
Metadata Service
Stores file directory structures, permissions, chunk manifest lists, and version history in MySQL/PostgreSQL (Sharded).
Block Storage (S3)
Raw encrypted 4MB chunk blocks stored in Amazon S3 object storage with CDN acceleration.',
  setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'Dropbox Sync'), 'A')
    || setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'Dropbox Sync'), 'B')
    || setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'Global file synchronization service storing petabytes of user data. Key challenges: block-level chunking, deduplication, conflict resolution, delta sync.
Block Chunking & Deduplication
Files are split into fixed 4MB Chunk Blocks. Each chunk is hashed using SHA-256.
 • Deduplication: Before uploading a chunk, client queries Metadata DB for the chunk''s SHA-256 hash. If hash exists, upload is skipped! Saves ~40% cloud storage.
 • Delta Sync: When a file is edited, only modified 4MB chunks are uploaded.
System Architecture
Metadata Service
Stores file directory structures, permissions, chunk manifest lists, and version history in MySQL/PostgreSQL (Sharded).
Block Storage (S3)
Raw encrypted 4MB chunk blocks stored in Amazon S3 object storage with CDN acceleration.'), 'C'),
  TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-07 03:23:53+00'
