Base62 Encoding vs KGS
Base62 Encoding
Alphabet: [a-z, A-Z, 0-9] (62 chars). A 7-character string yields 62^7 = 3.52 Trillion unique URLs.
 Convert auto-incrementing DB ID integer to Base62: 100,000,000 → ''ft7l''.
Key Generation Service (KGS)
Standalone service pre-generates random 7-character keys and stores them in Key DB. Workers load key batches into RAM. Eliminates runtime hashing collisions completely!
Redirection Read Path
Client (GET /ft7l) → Redis Cache → 301 / 302 Redirect to Original URL',
  setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'TinyURL Shortener'), 'A')
    || setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'TinyURL Shortener'), 'B')
    || setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'High-throughput URL shortening service handling 100M URLs/day with sub-10ms redirection latency.
Base62 Encoding vs KGS
Base62 Encoding
Alphabet: [a-z, A-Z, 0-9] (62 chars). A 7-character string yields 62^7 = 3.52 Trillion unique URLs.
 Convert auto-incrementing DB ID integer to Base62: 100,000,000 → ''ft7l''.
Key Generation Service (KGS)
Standalone service pre-generates random 7-character keys and stores them in Key DB. Workers load key batches into RAM. Eliminates runtime hashing collisions completely!
Redirection Read Path
Client (GET /ft7l) → Redis Cache → 301 / 302 Redirect to Original URL'), 'C'),
  TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-07 03:23:53+00'
WHERE EXISTS (
  SELECT 1 FROM "notes"."Note" n
  WHERE n.id = '72b8cf4d-ab57-7aaa-92e3-f8c9752376ff' AND n.visibility = 'PUBLIC' AND n."publishedVersionId" = '0d1e869a-a2ad-7d9b-b90c-4147571ddedd' AND n."deletedAt" IS NULL
)
