SELECT 'bb271661-abeb-7d98-ad42-a6f1ae74deda', 'b4fe329d-f4f7-7f9a-9e95-fc90d43ebb68', 'Pulling & Syncing', 'Pulling & Syncing', 'Updating your local repository to match remote updates on GitHub.
Pull
Pulling fetches the latest commits from the remote repository and immediately integrates (merges) them into your active local branch.
Running a Pull
# Fetch and merge remote changes
git pull origin main
Git Fetch vs Git Pull
It is critical to distinguish between fetch and pull:
git fetch Downloads remote changes to database only Safe (doesn''t modify working files)
git pull Downloads remote changes + immediately merges Active (can cause merge conflicts)
Under the hood, running git pull is exactly equivalent to running git fetch followed immediately by git merge.',
  setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'Pulling & Syncing'), 'A')
    || setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'Pulling & Syncing'), 'B')
    || setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'Updating your local repository to match remote updates on GitHub.
Pull
Pulling fetches the latest commits from the remote repository and immediately integrates (merges) them into your active local branch.
Running a Pull
