Stripe	REST + Webhooks	gRPC	SSE
GitHub	REST + GraphQL	gRPC	SSE
Netflix	REST	gRPC	WebSockets
Slack	REST + Webhooks	Kafka + gRPC	WebSockets'), 'C'),
