Double negation	¬¬P ≡ P
Distributivity	P ∨ (Q ∧ R) ≡ (P ∨ Q) ∧ (P ∨ R)
Inference rule	From	Infer
Modus ponens	P ⇒ Q, P	Q
Modus tollens	P ⇒ Q, ¬Q	¬P
And-elimination	P ∧ Q	P
Resolution	P ∨ Q, ¬Q ∨ R	P ∨ R
What is the difference between entailment and inference?
