ent can read from or write to the shared memory, allowing asynchronous parallel execution with deterministic state transitions."}]}]}},"revision":1}]'::jsonb, '019a118c-f480-7000-8000-000000000001', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-07 03:23:53+00'
