Tool Calling / Function Calling
The model outputs structured arguments (JSON) indicating a function it wants to invoke (e.g., get_weather(location="Seattle")). The backend executes the function, feeds the result back to the model, and the model synthesizes the final response.'), 'C'),
  TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-07 03:23:53+00'
