Vector Database
A database optimized for storing, indexing, and executing vector searches. It handles metadata filtering, updates, and fast ANN indexing (using graphs or quantizations) alongside typical database operations. Examples: Pinecone, Chroma, Milvus.'), 'C'),
  TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-07 03:23:53+00'
